des Comiskey Park in its public park system and states that admission to all parks is free except vehicle admission at Eagle Point Park.","source_url":"https://www.cityofdubuque.org/Archive.aspx?ADID=2036","source_title":"News Release: Dubuque Parks Open for the Season","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Admission is free. Use ordinary public park areas; reservations, concessions, and separately scheduled programs are outside this activity.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"flora-krey-wahlert-park-court-session","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Flora Krey Wahlert Park","title":"Bring a Game to Flora Park","subtitle":"Flora Krey Wahlert Park on Pennsylvania Avenue","notes":"Coordinate a casual game, carry the equipment your group needs, and use an unreserved public area rather than a rentable pavilion.","short_summary":"A flexible free park session for friends who want to move rather than spend.","evidence_claim":"The City lists Flora Krey Wahlert Park within its park system and states that park admission is free, aside from Eagle Point vehicle admission.","source_url":"https://www.cityofdubuque.org/Archive.aspx?ADID=2036","source_title":"News Release: Dubuque Parks Open for the Season","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"General admission is free. Pavilion reservations, pool access, concessions, and organized programs are not included.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"louis-murphy-park-picnic","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Louis Murphy Park","title":"Pack a Picnic for the Overlook","subtitle":"Louis Murphy Park in south Dubuque","notes":"Bring food from home, meet at an open picnic area, and take in the park's Mississippi River outlook without reserving a pavilion.","short_summary":"A bring-your-own picnic framed by elevated views over southern Dubuque and the river.","evidence_claim":"The City identifies Louis Murphy Park as part of its public system and states that admission to city parks is free except for Eagle Point vehicles.","source_url":"https://www.cityofdubuque.org/Archive.aspx?ADID=2036","source_title":"News Release: Dubuque Parks Open for the Season","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free general park admission. Bring food from home; pavilion rental and any purchases are excluded from this plan.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"washington-park-gazebo-meetup","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Washington Park","title":"Gather by the Washington Park Gazebo","subtitle":"Washington Park in downtown Dubuque","notes":"Choose the gazebo as an easy meeting landmark, then talk or play a portable game in an open area without booking the structure.","short_summary":"A central downtown rendezvous anchored by a recognizable historic park feature.","evidence_claim":"The City names Washington Park among its public parks and states that admission to all parks is free except vehicle admission at Eagle Point Park.","source_url":"https://www.cityofdubuque.org/Archive.aspx?ADID=2036","source_title":"News Release: Dubuque Parks Open for the Season","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"General park access is free. The gazebo may be rented, but no reservation or exclusive use is part of this activity.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mississippi-riverwalk-stroll","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Mississippi Riverwalk","title":"Stroll the Mississippi Riverwalk","subtitle":"Port of Dubuque riverfront","notes":"Meet at the Riverwalk for a walk, jog, or seated river-view break; keep nearby shops and ticketed attractions optional and separate.","short_summary":"A year-round public riverfront walk with landscaping, seating, and Mississippi views.","evidence_claim":"The City's FAQ says the Riverwalk is enjoyed year-round, describes walking and sitting there, and confirms it remains open to the general public even during rentals.","source_url":"https://www.cityofdubuque.org/1583/Mississippi-Riverwalk-FAQs","source_title":"Mississippi Riverwalk FAQs","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The Riverwalk remains open to the general public, including during permitted public events. No reservation is needed for an ordinary stroll.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
